  instructionText: "LO2.1 - A server must be identifiable on the network before anything
    else.\n\nOpen System Properties \u2014 either \"This PC\" on the desktop or \"System\"
    on the Start menu will get you there. Go to the Computer Name tab and click Change\u2026.
    Type the host name given on the job order, then click OK twice and restart when
    prompted."
